Name:         each-cli
Version:      1.0.0
Description:  -
Created:      2026-01-02T03:04:05Z

INPUT    TYPE   DEFAULT  REQUIRED
regions  array  -        -

TASK     USES   NEEDS    TIMEOUT
list     shell  -        300s
convert  shell  list     300s
